        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-MBR-833KR-13.5 Victorian Shower Door Handles</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese very decorative victorian design glass shower door handles are <b>1-3/16\" Diameter</b> with a <b>3-1/4\" projection</b>.  They are hand made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions in your choice of 4 standard finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/decorative-reed-cabinet-knob-and-rose-first-impressions-833k-833kr\"><b>Cabinet Knobs</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/ornate-victorian-floor-door-stop-first-impressions-918r-f\"><b>Victorian Door Stop</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-18-specifications.gif?v=1704354715\" width=\"295\" height=\"226\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Victorian Shower Door Handle Details\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese victorian design shower handles are very elaborate yet graceful and are sure to become a focal point in any bathroom.   \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions SD-MBR-833KR-13.5 Victorian Shower Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Overall Length: 13-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 10\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Rosette Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 4</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These beautiful victorian design shower door pulls are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
